# Enter Start Game, allow the opening cinematic to finish, then walk/attack.
# This route uses normal inputs; it does not write game memory.
WAIT_RAM16 FFB002 0001
WAIT_RAM16 FFB004 0001
PRESS START 2
WAIT 4
WAIT_RAM16 FFB004 0004
PRESS START 2
WAIT 4
WAIT_RAM16 FFB002 0004
WAIT_RAM16 FFB194 0000
WAIT 3400
HOLD RIGHT
HOLD A
